Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "password": "123456",
  "nickname": "测试用户"
}

### 登录
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "password": "123456"
}

